sequenceDiagram
    actor Staff
    participant Browser
    participant MVC as AppointmentController
    participant Svc as AppointmentService
    participant UoW as UnitOfWork
    participant DB as SQL Server

    Staff->>Browser: Open Appointment/Create
    Browser->>MVC: GET Create(patientId?)
    MVC->>Svc: GetCreateForm(patientId)
    Svc->>DB: SELECT Patients Doctors Staff
    Svc-->>MVC: CreateAppointmentViewModel
    MVC-->>Browser: Appointment form

    Staff->>Browser: Select doctor and date
    Browser->>MVC: GET GetAvailableSlots(doctorId, date)
    MVC->>Svc: GetAvailableSlotStarts()
    Svc->>DB: SELECT DoctorAvailabilities existing Appointments
    Svc-->>MVC: available time slots
    MVC-->>Browser: JSON slots list

    Staff->>Browser: Submit appointment details
    Browser->>MVC: POST Create
    MVC->>MVC: Validate ModelState

    alt Invalid or slot conflict
        MVC->>Svc: TryCreate returns false
        Svc-->>MVC: error message
        MVC-->>Browser: Form with error
    else Valid booking
        MVC->>Svc: TryCreate(model)
        Svc->>UoW: Add Appointment entity
        UoW->>DB: INSERT Appointments
        DB-->>UoW: appointment Id
        Svc-->>MVC: success
        MVC-->>Browser: Redirect Appointment/Index
        Browser-->>Staff: Success message and appointment list
    end
